### V3.3.8 支付多车订单
POST http://localhost:5129/api/rental-orders/21/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: 0e1f2a3b-4c5d-4e6f-9a7b-8c9d0e1f2a3b

{
  "method": "MockWallet"
}




### Operator 交付车辆
POST http://localhost:5129/api/rental-orders/21/items/31/handover
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}




### User 归还车辆
POST http://localhost:5129/api/rental-orders/21/items/31/return
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}


### Operator 领取车辆的验车任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/8/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}



### Operator 提交车辆验车通过
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/8/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Passed",
  "resultNotes": "Vehicle condition is normal."
}



### Operator 领取车辆的验车任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/4/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}



### Operator 提交车辆验车失败
POST http://localhost:5129/api/inspections/4/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Failed",
  "resultNotes": "Brake performance abnormal. Maintenance required."
}


### V3.3.8 Operator 领取车辆23维修任务
POST http://localhost:5129/api/maintenances/2/claim
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}


### V3.3.8 提交车辆23维修完成申请
POST http://localhost:5129/api/maintenances/2/submit-repair
Authorization: Bearer {{OperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "repairNotes": "Brake components replaced. Brake performance tested and confirmed.",
  "repairCost": 650.00
}


### V3.3.8 Admin 复核车辆23维修通过
POST http://localhost:5129/api/maintenances/2/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approved": true,
  "verificationNotes": "Brake system inspection passed. Vehicle cleared for operation."
}




### 1. Admin 查询全部订单
GET http://localhost:5129/api/admin/rental-orders?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}



### 1. 查询 Item 23 的退款预览
GET http://localhost:5129/api/rental-order-items/23/settlement-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}

### 2. 查询 Item 24 的退款预览
GET http://localhost:5129/api/rental-order-items/24/settlement-preview
Authorization: Bearer {{UserToken}}



### 1. 查询全部可预订车辆
GET http://localhost:5129/api/vehicles/availability?startAt=2026-11-05T08:00:00Z&endAt=2026-11-08T08:00:00Z&page=1&pageSize=10

